{"route":{"id":"38069","name":"Ruta dels rellotges de sol de Seva","intro":"A la <strong>“Ruta dels rellotges de sol de Seva”</strong> aprofitarem el fil conductor de les ubicacions dels diferents <strong>rellotges de sol,</strong> que trobarem en el poble de Seva, per recórrer l’entorn natural més pròxim, del qual coneixerem detalls dels seus <strong>cultius, boscos i geologia, </strong>mentre descobrim el món dels <strong>rellotges de sol.</strong>","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Mitjana","durada":"","desnivell":"192.00 meters","distancia":"8.20 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Temàtic","imgs":["n38069_1.jpg","n38069_2.jpg","n38069_3.jpg","n38069_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-barcelona/rutes-senderisme-seva/ruta-dels-rellotges-de-sol-de-seva","track":[[41.83776,2.28113],[41.8375,2.28114],[41.83725,2.28087],[41.83708,2.28049],[41.83689,2.28],[41.83671,2.27952],[41.83655,2.27915],[41.83628,2.27894],[41.83616,2.27895],[41.83598,2.27909],[41.83572,2.27916],[41.83547,2.27923],[41.83524,2.27936],[41.83505,2.27958],[41.83485,2.2798],[41.83466,2.28002],[41.8344,2.28029],[41.83417,2.28058],[41.83368,2.28],[41.83337,2.27978],[41.83327,2.27978],[41.83316,2.27986],[41.83304,2.28011],[41.83286,2.28011],[41.83261,2.27999],[41.83241,2.27988],[41.83216,2.27978],[41.83195,2.27971],[41.83187,2.27968],[41.83162,2.27987],[41.83135,2.28011],[41.83105,2.28048],[41.83078,2.28081],[41.83071,2.28102],[41.83053,2.28131],[41.83036,2.28161],[41.8303,2.2817],[41.83028,2.28193],[41.83014,2.28216],[41.82992,2.28236],[41.82976,2.28262],[41.82967,2.28272],[41.82958,2.28294],[41.82948,2.2831],[41.82943,2.28332],[41.82937,2.28338],[41.82922,2.28333],[41.82908,2.28335],[41.82891,2.28347],[41.82879,2.28357],[41.82866,2.28378],[41.82854,2.28391],[41.82842,2.28377],[41.82823,2.28341],[41.82805,2.28294],[41.82798,2.28276],[41.82766,2.28229],[41.82799,2.28275],[41.82817,2.28328],[41.82832,2.28357],[41.82845,2.28382],[41.82857,2.28401],[41.82863,2